<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hewlett-Packard EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch analyst George Elling said he raised his earnings estimate for Hewlett-Packard Co's fiscal year ending October 31, 1997, to the high end of his previous estimate range.</p>
<p>-- Elling said he estimated the computer maker would earn $3 per share in fiscal 1997, compared to his previous range of $2.75 to $3.</p>
<p>-- The analyst said he maintained his attractive rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
